        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for a completely valid use case! I very rarely use tabs so almost always forget to make modules work with them.\r\n\r\nAt the moment 'mini.starter' was designed to work only with a single buffer opened. But your example is a type of behavior I would like to support. I'll work on it (not immediately, though, unfortunately).",
