            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "@bzub, sorry for the long wait. This should now be possible. For your use case I'd recommend doing this: `autocmd TabNewEntered * ++nested lua MiniStarter.open()` (as there might be some autocommands involved in `open()`).\r\n\r\nThis required an order of magnitude more changes than I'd like to. This is the price of an initially and consciously lazy design :(",
